  "details": "All of the items added to the exclusive shop(the one for items, portals, and such, not groups or avatars) have been limited time, and I assume won't return. This means a player won't be able to have an item because they didn't check the shop in November or couldn't afford it at the time. I find this very frustrating. I don't mind it for holiday specific or collaboration items, those make sense. However, I can't buy a fairly generic party popper entrance effect because I didn't have extra money at the time. So, I would like to request items be added that are permanent, or at least last longer than a month or two, and less items be limited. In the future if Vrchat sells a portal that's just purple, would that need to be limited? I don't understand why that'd be but that's the current way the exclusive shop seems to work. I don't see why the wizard items were limited.",
